@startuml
title PayPal Payment Flow

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
participant PayPal

User -> Frontend: Click "Pay with PayPal"

Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/payment/paypal/create-order\n{ Selected_List_Object,\n  Price_currency }
Backend -> PayPal: POST /v2/checkout/orders\n(Access Token valid)
PayPal --> Backend: ApprovalURL + OrderId
Backend --> Frontend: { id: OrderId }

Frontend -> User: Redirect to PayPal
User -> PayPal: Approve payment

PayPal --> User: Redirect back\n(included OrderId)
User -> Frontend: Return from PayPal

Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/payment/paypal/capture-order\n{ OrderId }
Backend -> PayPal: POST /v2/checkout/orders/{OrderId}/capture\n(Access Token valid)

PayPal --> Backend: Capture result\n(SUCCESS / FAILED)
Backend --> Frontend: Payment Status
Frontend --> User: Show Result

@enduml
